    "headlineBefore": "The parts you",
    "headlineScript": "remember",
    "headlineAfter": "",
    "intro": "From weddings to portraits, and so much more, I believe the best photographs are the ones that feel effortless and the ones that feel like the real you. All of life's most meaningful moments can be captured. My goal is to capture the memories that feel genuine to you.",
    "closingHeading": "Dates open through fall",
    "closingBody": "Whether you're planning a big event or simply want to capture the season you're in, I'd love to be a part of it. Reach out to me with your goals, date, and time! I'll be in touch within one business day."
  },
  "about": {
    "portrait": {
      "src": "/photos/hattiepfp-msf2bye3si3.jpg",
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 1920,
      "lqip": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
      "alt": "Girl with glasses leaning on wood in greenery with white dress on"
    },
    "heading": "About Hattie",
    "body": [
      "Hi, I'm Hattie- the girl behind the camera. I'm a natural light photographer currently based in Fort Worth, TX. I have always had a knack for photography, and now I get to use that to help others get the photos of their dreams. When I'm not chasing the sunset with my camera in hand or corralling little ones and fur babies for family photos, I'm surrounding myself with my favorite people and my own fur babies, most likely outdoors.",
      "For me, photography has always been more than just a pretty picture - it is about preserving special moments, big or small, that become some of our favorite memories. From quiet smiles, emotional tears, loud laughter, and the in-between, I am here to capture it.  I love photographing people.",
      "My goal is to create a relaxed experience filled with real emotions where you feel your best. If you have never been in front of the camera or don’t like it - don’t worry. Almost everyone tells me they’re nervous, and within several minutes they’re more relaxed. Just be yourself, and I’ll do the rest."
    ],
    "pullQuote": "I can't wait to capture your story."
  },
  "booking": {
    "heading": "Booking",
    "intro": [
      "Pick a time below and we will talk for twenty minutes — what you want, where, roughly when, and whether I am the right person for it. No deposit at this stage.",
      "If nothing on the calendar works, email me and we will find something. Weekends book out first, usually three to four months ahead."
    ],
    "fallbackNote": "Calendar not loading?"
  },
  "contact": {
    "heading": "Contact",
    "intro": "The more you can tell me here, the more useful my first reply is — I would rather quote you properly than send you a rate card.",
    "autoResponseSubject": "Thanks — I have your message",
    "autoResponseBody": "Thanks for getting in touch. I have your message and I answer everything within one working day, usually sooner. If it has been longer than that, something has gone wrong on my end — please reply to this email and nudge me.\n\n— Hattie"
  },
